title: Infoblox: Tenant host rollup
agents: infoblox_csp
catalog: cloud/infoblox
license: GPLv2
distribution: mkp
description:
 Reports how many NIOS-X servers in the tenant are online out of the total,
 names any that are not, and lists the distinct versions in use.

 This gives a single service that changes state if any server leaves the
 online state, which is useful as an overview alongside the per server
 checks.

discovery:
 One service is created on the tenant host.
